<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Task Overdue — Handla</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #0a0a0f; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; color: #e2e8f0; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: rgba(15,15,30,0.95); border: 1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.35); border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d97706 0%, #b45309 100%); padding: 32px 40px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; letter-spacing: -0.3px; }
    .body { padding: 40px; }
    .greeting { font-size: 16px; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .alert-banner { background: rgba(245,158,11,0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.35); border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px 20px; margin-bottom: 24px; font-size: 14px; color: #fcd34d; text-align: center; font-weight: 600; }
    .detail-card { background: rgba(245,158,11,0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.2); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .row:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .label { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #fbbf24; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.8px; }
    .val { font-size: 15px; color: #e2e8f0; font-weight: 500; text-align: right; max-width: 60%; }
    .title-val { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #e2e8f0; }
    .overdue-val { color: #f87171; font-weight: 600; }
    .cta-wrapper { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .cta-btn { display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d97706, #b45309); color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 36px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; }
    .divider { border: none; border-top: 1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.15); margin: 24px 0; }
    .footer { text-align: center; color: #475569; font-size: 12px; padding: 0 40px 32px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .footer a { color: #fbbf24; text-decoration: none; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>⏰ Task Overdue</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p class="greeting">Hi <strong>{{recipientName}}</strong>,</p>
      <div class="alert-banner">⏰ This task is past its due date and requires immediate attention.</div>
      <p style="color:#94a3b8;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:20px;">
        The following task has not been completed by its deadline. Please update its status or take action immediately.
      </p>
      <div class="detail-card">
        <div class="row">
          <span class="label">Task</span>
          <span class="val title-val">{{taskTitle}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <span class="label">Was Due</span>
          <span class="val overdue-val">{{dueDate}}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-wrapper">
        <a href="{{erpUrl}}" class="cta-btn">Update Task →</a>
      </div>
      <hr class="divider" />
      <p style="color:#64748b;font-size:13px;text-align:center;margin:0;">
        Task ID: <strong>{{taskId}}</strong>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>You're receiving this because a task assigned to you is overdue on <a href="{{baseUrl}}">Handla</a>.</p>
      <p>© {{year}} Handla. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
